# Bundled lesson pictures
#
# Put raster pictures (jpg/png/webp) here and reference them in a lesson with
# the `figure` block, e.g.  { "src": "img/serra-da-estrela.jpg", "alt": "…" }.
# This folder is served at the site root in dev and copied into the build.
#
# Prefer inline SVG illustrations (written straight in the .md, theme-aware,
# no licensing) over raster images whenever you can.
